  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Human Capital Acceleration Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the proposed partnership is to support government to establish strong leadership, improve the quality of spending on national and local programs, improve sector and local performance and empower citizen engagement in frontline service delivery through programmatic policy, advisory, analytics and technical support to realize the government&apos;s vision to improve human capital results.</narrative>
  </description>
